      "mergedPostDetails": "this is a problem because while flicking through the social, avatar or QM in general, you will often release the trigger while pointing at someone behind the QM. this really screws up scrolling in the social menu\nwhat I expect: to select someone you must start and end the click on them. this is how the rest of the QM works\n\nvideo: https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/338014423459430400/899189859867050044/gxJ9qIxL18.mp4",
      "mergedPostTitle": "[1140] with quick menu open, holding trigger off of someone then releasing trigger on someone selects them",
